# NAME: Claude Login - OPTIONAL SHARED AUTHENTICATION
# TARGET: Shadowrocket RULE-SET
# UPDATED: 2026-11-01
# ACTIVE RULES: 6
# Common Google/Apple identity endpoints, not Claude-exclusive domains.
# Enable only if needed. Other apps using these hosts are affected too.
# The exact login flow can require additional hosts; this is not a full IdP allowlist.

# Google account sign-in.
DOMAIN,accounts.google.com
DOMAIN,oauth2.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,www.googleapis.com

# Sign in with Apple.
DOMAIN,appleid.apple.com
DOMAIN,appleid.cdn-apple.com
DOMAIN,idmsa.apple.com
